    ember accent\n2 Carnival \u2014 HATE: four full-saturation districts in one room,
    no orbs\n3 Deepwater \u2014 LOVE: coolest and most restrained, 30 high star-orbs,
    near-full mirror\n4 Two-Tone \u2014 NEUTRAL: one range plus a real second cast
    hue at smaller scale\n5 Churn \u2014 HATE: the orb hook kept but fast and loud,
    160 orbs, full neon\n6 Lantern \u2014 LOVE: warm range, 18 large slow orbs low
    in the room\n7 Flatlight \u2014 HATE: mid-saturation everywhere, no near-black,
    no orbs, no motion"
